 1 MiB。\n- list_dir：列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。\n\n## 工作区（写代码、跑测试）\n本轮有一个工作区：write_file / read_file / list_dir 读写其中的文件，exec_shell 在其中运行 bash 命令（当前目录即工作区根目录，用相对路径）。文件在工具调用之间保留，进程不保留：每条命令都在全新的无网络沙箱中运行，不要启动后台服务，也不要安装网络上的包。\n- 需要多个文件、反复修改并运行（例如写代码再跑测试、看报错再修）时用工作区；一次性的计算仍用 run_python。\n- 典型流程：write_file 写代码与测试 → exec_shell 运行（如 python3 -m unittest -v）→ 读输出，失败时 read_file 查看、修改后再运行。回复中的运行结果以命令的实际输出为准。\n- exec_shell 与 run_python 共用本任务的代码执行配额，不计入工具额度；read_file、write_file、list_dir 不计额度。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 exec_shell 或 run_python。\n- 工作区只属于本轮，下一轮不保留。\n\n## 会话状态\n这是会话的第一轮。","role":"system"},{"content":"# CSV 首条记录丢失\n\n`read_records(\"name,city\\nAda,London\\n\")` 应返回一条包含 Ada 和 London 的记录，目前返回空列表。修复 `records.py`，保留 CSV 的字段解析与记录顺序。只有表头时应返回空列表。\n\n任务工作区从 `repo/` 创建。验收测试由评测端保管。\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","role":"user"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\"}","name":"read_file"},"id":"call_36780bf4bb0c404db4cd5afa","type":"function"}]},{"content":"records.py（第 1–8 行，共 8 行）\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n    next(reader, None)\n    return list(reader)\n","name":"read_file","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_36780bf4bb0c404db4cd5afa"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\", \"content\": \"import csv\\nfrom io import StringIO\\n\\n\\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\\n    if not source.strip():\\n        return []\\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\\n    next(reader, None)\\n    return list(reader)\"}","name":"write_file"},"id":"call_2381df903d79432094dcc9a0","type":"function"}]},{"content":"已覆盖 records.py（229 字节）。工作区：1 个文件，229 字节","name":"write_file","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_2381df903d79432094dcc9a0"},{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -c \\\"import sys; from records import read_records; print(read_records('name,city\\\\nAda,London\\\\n'))\\\"\"}","name":"exec_shell"},"id":"call_aab81430adef4baebc213932","type":"function"}]},{"content":"状态：completed（退出码 0）\n用时 22 ms\nstdout（3 字节）：\n[]\n\nstderr：（空）\n文件变化：无\n工作区：1 个文件，229 字节","name":"exec_shell","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_aab81430adef4baebc213932"}],"tools":[{"function":{"description":"读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。","name":"read_skill","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"file":{"description":"skill 目录内的相对路径；省略则读 SKILL.md","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"name":{"description":"skill 名称，如 deep-research","minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；需要正文时再用 web_fetch 抓取具体页面。","name":"web_search","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"max_results":{"description":"返回条数，缺省 5","maximum":10,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"query":{"description":"搜索词","maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；同一网页重复抓取不新增来源。","name":"web_fetch","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"url":{"description":"http:// 或 https:// 开头的网址","maxLength":2048,"minLength":8,"type":"string"}},"required":["url"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。","name":"read_source","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"n":{"description":"来源编号","minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["n"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。用于计算、数据处理与核对数字。可读取 /in 下的输入文件，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出返回。","name":"run_python","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"code":{"maxLength":262144,"type":"string"},"inputs":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"sha256":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"}},"required":["sha256","path"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":64,"type":"array"},"timeout_s":{"maximum":300,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["code"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。文件在命令之间保留，进程不保留（不要启动后台服务）；适合运行测试、脚本、编译、grep、查看目录等。返回退出码、stdout/stderr 与本次新增、修改、删除的文件。","name":"exec_shell","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"command":{"maxLength":65536,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"timeout_s":{"maximum":300,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["command"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。","name":"read_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"max_lines":{"maximum":2000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"path":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"start_line":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。executable=true 时设为可执行。delete=true 时删除该文件或整个目录（不给 content）。","name":"write_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"content":{"maxLength":1048576,"type":"string"},"delete":{"type":"boolean"},"executable":{"type":"boolean"},"path":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。","name":"list_dir","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"maxLength":512,"type":"string"},"recursive":{"type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"}},"type":"function"}]},"response_ref":"d65a0dc5731ce28b135b97905e414a7dbad767babe4efcf81c0f5eb2cfe9a624"},"step_id":"orch","text":"修复后的代码未正确处理 CSV 的首行表头。我们需要确保在读取 CSV 时，表头行被正确识别并跳过，同时保留其余记录。当前的代码在处理空字符串时返回空列表，但未正确处理表头行。\n\n让我们重新审视问题并修复代码：\n\n1. 确保 CSV 文件包含表头行。\n2. 使用 `csv.DictReader` 正确跳过表头行。\n3. 确保在没有数据行时返回空列表。\n\n以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source.strip():\n        return []\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n    next(reader, None)  # 跳过表头行\n    return list(reader)\n```\n\n我们将使用 `exec_shell` 运行测试以验证修复是否成功。"},"internal":{"source":"worker","type":"progress","attempt_id":"a9192b3bc8d51dab3c392be7f633a3a9","task_seq":17,"payload":{"v":1,"ts":"2026-11-26T10:18:26.515Z","seq":12,"data":{"raw":{"call_id":"root/orch/chat/4","request":{"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_skill","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["name"],"properties":{"file":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"skill 目录内的相对路径；省略则读 SKILL.md"},"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"description":"skill 名称，如 deep-research"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"web_search","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["query"],"properties":{"query":{"type":"string","maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"description":"搜索词"},"max_results":{"type":"integer","maximum":10,"minimum":1,"description":"返回条数，缺省 5"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；需要正文时再用 web_fetch 抓取具体页面。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"web_fetch","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["url"],"properties":{"url":{"type":"string","maxLength":2048,"minLength":8,"description":"http:// 或 https:// 开头的网址"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。每次调用消耗 1 次本轮工具额度；同一网页重复抓取不新增来源。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_source","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["n"],"properties":{"n":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"来源编号"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"run_python","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["code"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string","maxLength":262144},"inputs":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["sha256","path"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"sha256":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$"}},"additionalProperties":false},"maxItems":64},"timeout_s":{"type":"integer","maximum":300,"minimum":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。用于计算、数据处理与核对数字。可读取 /in 下的输入文件，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出返回。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_shell","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["command"],"properties":{"command":{"type":"string","maxLength":65536,"minLength":1},"timeout_s":{"type":"integer","maximum":300,"minimum":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。文件在命令之间保留，进程不保留（不要启动后台服务）；适合运行测试、脚本、编译、grep、查看目录等。返回退出码、stdout/stderr 与本次新增、修改、删除的文件。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["path"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":512,"minLength":1},"max_lines":{"type":"integer","maximum":2000,"minimum":1},"start_line":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["path"],"properties":{"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":512,"minLength":1},"delete":{"type":"boolean"},"content":{"type":"string","maxLength":1048576},"executable":{"type":"boolean"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。executable=true 时设为可执行。delete=true 时删除该文件或整个目录（不给 content）。"}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"list_dir","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","maxLength":512},"recursive":{"type":"boolean"}},"additionalProperties":false},"description":"列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。"}}],"messages":[{"role":"system","content":"你是 agentbox 的对话助手，同时是研究编排者。根据用户的问题决定直接回答还是开展深度研究。\n\n## 规则\n1. 简单事实、定义、计算、闲聊、写作润色，或能从对话记忆直接回答的问题：直接回答，不读 skill、不提问；必要时可少量 web_search / web_fetch 核实。\n2. 需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题：先调用 read_skill(\"deep-research\") 读取研究流程，并严格按其执行（计划 → 逐个 research_subtopic → 写报告）。\n3. 工具额度：本轮 web_search + web_fetch 合计 30 次，由系统强制；每个计数工具的结果末尾显示已用与剩余次数。模型调用、read_skill、read_source、run_python、ask_user、todo_write、research_subtopic 本身不计数。额度用尽后不要再调用工具，直接用已有材料作答。\n4. 提问：只有研究范围不明确（时间、地区、目的、深度）时，在读取 skill 之后、写计划之前用 ask_user 提一轮选择题（至多 3 题）；简单问答不提问；计划写出或开始搜索后不再提问。\n5. 引用：只能用 [n] 引用 web_fetch 读过、带编号的来源（含下面列出的既往来源）；不得编造编号，不写参考文献列表（系统自动附证据列表）。\n6. 不再调用工具的回复即本轮的最终回复：直接给出回答，或研究时给出完整报告正文（Markdown，以 \"# 标题\" 开头）。\n7. 用与用户相同的语言回复。\n8. 运行代码：回答和研究时都可用 run_python 做计算、数据处理、单位换算、把来源中的数字整理成表格、快速核对推算；沙箱没有网络，不要用它访问网页（网页只用 web_search / web_fetch）；能直接写出结果的简单算术不要调用。用 print 输出结果，写入 /out 的文件会作为输出文件保存并在结果中列出。回复中的计算结果以代码的实际输出为准；取自来源的数字照常用 [n] 引用来源。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 run_python。\n\n## Skill 目录（用 read_skill(name) 按需读取正文）\n- deep-research：对需要多来源核实、比较、趋势或综述的问题做深度研究，产出带编号引用的报告；简单事实、闲聊或可从对话记忆直接回答的问题不要使用。\n\n## 工具\n- read_skill：读取 skill 的说明：只给 name 时返回 SKILL.md 正文（流程与规则）；给出 file（如 \"references/report-template.md\"）时返回该参考文件。\n- web_search：搜索网页，返回标题、站点、摘要与 URL。\n- web_fetch：抓取一个 http(s) 网页的正文，并把它登记为本轮来源 [n]（报告中以 [n] 引用）。\n- read_source：重读本轮已收集的来源 [n] 的正文（最多约 12 KiB），用于核对细节；不访问网络，不消耗工具额度。\n- run_python：在隔离沙箱中运行一段 Python 3 代码（无网络、无状态、每次全新环境）。\n- ask_user：研究开始前、范围不明确时向用户提一轮选择题（至多 3 题，每题 2–4 个互斥选项；界面自动追加“其他…”）。\n- todo_write：写出或更新研究计划清单（完整清单，覆盖上一份）。\n- research_subtopic：执行研究计划：运行时把计划中全部未完成的子主题同时交给各自独立的执行者（另一个模型，按简报搜索、阅读并写摘要），全部结束后一次返回各子主题带 [n] 引用的摘要，失败、超时或部分完成的子主题会标注“不完整”。\n- exec_shell：在本轮工作区中运行一条 bash 命令（无网络的隔离沙箱，当前目录即工作区根目录）。\n- read_file：读取本轮工作区中的文本文件（相对路径），可指定起始行与行数；一次至多 2000 行、256 KiB。\n- write_file：在本轮工作区中写入（新建或覆盖）一个文本文件，路径为相对路径，上级目录自动建立；内容至多 1 MiB。\n- list_dir：列出本轮工作区中的目录（缺省为根目录）；recursive=true 时列出其下全部文件。\n\n## 工作区（写代码、跑测试）\n本轮有一个工作区：write_file / read_file / list_dir 读写其中的文件，exec_shell 在其中运行 bash 命令（当前目录即工作区根目录，用相对路径）。文件在工具调用之间保留，进程不保留：每条命令都在全新的无网络沙箱中运行，不要启动后台服务，也不要安装网络上的包。\n- 需要多个文件、反复修改并运行（例如写代码再跑测试、看报错再修）时用工作区；一次性的计算仍用 run_python。\n- 典型流程：write_file 写代码与测试 → exec_shell 运行（如 python3 -m unittest -v）→ 读输出，失败时 read_file 查看、修改后再运行。回复中的运行结果以命令的实际输出为准。\n- exec_shell 与 run_python 共用本任务的代码执行配额，不计入工具额度；read_file、write_file、list_dir 不计额度。结果提示代码执行配额已用完时不要再调用 exec_shell 或 run_python。\n- 工作区只属于本轮，下一轮不保留。\n\n## 会话状态\n这是会话的第一轮。"},{"role":"user","content":"# CSV 首条记录丢失\n\n`read_records(\"name,city\\nAda,London\\n\")` 应返回一条包含 Ada 和 London 的记录，目前返回空列表。修复 `records.py`，保留 CSV 的字段解析与记录顺序。只有表头时应返回空列表。\n\n任务工作区从 `repo/` 创建。验收测试由评测端保管。\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell."},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_36780bf4bb0c404db4cd5afa","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\"}"}}]},{"name":"read_file","role":"tool","content":"records.py（第 1–8 行，共 8 行）\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n    next(reader, None)\n    return list(reader)\n","tool_call_id":"call_36780bf4bb0c404db4cd5afa"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_2381df903d79432094dcc9a0","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"records.py\", \"content\": \"import csv\\nfrom io import StringIO\\n\\n\\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\\n    if not source.strip():\\n        return []\\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\\n    next(reader, None)\\n    return list(reader)\"}"}}]},{"name":"write_file","role":"tool","content":"已覆盖 records.py（229 字节）。工作区：1 个文件，229 字节","tool_call_id":"call_2381df903d79432094dcc9a0"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_aab81430adef4baebc213932","type":"function","function":{"name":"exec_shell","arguments":"{\"command\": \"python3 -c \\\"import sys; from records import read_records; print(read_records('name,city\\\\nAda,London\\\\n'))\\\"\"}"}}]},{"name":"exec_shell","role":"tool","content":"状态：completed（退出码 0）\n用时 22 ms\nstdout（3 字节）：\n[]\n\nstderr：（空）\n文件变化：无\n工作区：1 个文件，229 字节","tool_call_id":"call_aab81430adef4baebc213932"}],"max_tokens":16384},"response_ref":"d65a0dc5731ce28b135b97905e414a7dbad767babe4efcf81c0f5eb2cfe9a624"},"text":"修复后的代码未正确处理 CSV 的首行表头。我们需要确保在读取 CSV 时，表头行被正确识别并跳过，同时保留其余记录。当前的代码在处理空字符串时返回空列表，但未正确处理表头行。\n\n让我们重新审视问题并修复代码：\n\n1. 确保 CSV 文件包含表头行。\n2. 使用 `csv.DictReader` 正确跳过表头行。\n3. 确保在没有数据行时返回空列表。\n\n以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source.strip():\n        return []\n    reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n    next(reader, None)  # 跳过表头行\n    return list(reader)\n```\n\n我们将使用 `exec_shell` 运行测试以验证修复是否成功。","step_id":"orch"},"kind":"thinking","type":"progress","message":"思考","step_id":"orch","attempt_id":"a9192b3bc8d51dab3c392be7f633a3a9"}}}

