data: {"seq":24,"turn_id":"task_d56b8cc55e7b0bbcf195da3b580aa505","type":"assistant_delta","ts":"2026-11-26T18:18:33.952315+08:00","data":{"final":false,"message_id":"task_d56b8cc55e7b0bbcf195da3b580aa505-reply","text":"修复后的代码仍然未能正确处理 CSV 文件中的数据行。问题可能出在 `csv.DictReader` 的使用上，它可能没有正确解析 CSV 数据。我们需要进一步调试和修复代码。\n\n让我们尝试另一种方法，确保 CSV 数据被正确解析，并且表头行被正确跳过。以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source.strip():\n        return []\n    try:\n        reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n        next(reader, None)  # 跳过表头行\n        return list"},"internal":{"source":"worker","type":"progress","attempt_id":"a9192b3bc8d51dab3c392be7f633a3a9","task_seq":23,"payload":{"v":1,"ts":"2026-11-26T10:18:33.951Z","seq":17,"data":{"text":"修复后的代码仍然未能正确处理 CSV 文件中的数据行。问题可能出在 `csv.DictReader` 的使用上，它可能没有正确解析 CSV 数据。我们需要进一步调试和修复代码。\n\n让我们尝试另一种方法，确保 CSV 数据被正确解析，并且表头行被正确跳过。以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source.strip():\n        return []\n    try:\n        reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n        next(reader, None)  # 跳过表头行\n        return list","final":false,"message_id":"task_d56b8cc55e7b0bbcf195da3b580aa505-reply"},"kind":"assistant_delta","type":"progress","message":"回复","attempt_id":"a9192b3bc8d51dab3c392be7f633a3a9"}}}

