event: turn_result
data: {"seq":26,"turn_id":"task_d56b8cc55e7b0bbcf195da3b580aa505","type":"turn_result","ts":"2026-11-26T18:18:33.955044+08:00","data":{"outputs":[],"summary":"修复后的代码仍然未能正确处理 CSV 文件中的数据行。问题可能出在 `csv.DictReader` 的使用上，它可能没有正确解析 CSV 数据。我们需要进一步调试和修复代码。\n\n让我们尝试另一种方法，确保 CSV 数据被正确解析，并且表头行被正确跳过。以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source.strip():\n        return []\n    try:\n        reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n        next(reader, None)  # 跳过表头行\n        return list(reader)\n    except csv.Error as e:\n        print(f\"CSV error: {e}\")\n        return []\n```\n\n我们将使用 `exec_shell` 运行测试以验证修复是否成功。"},"internal":{"source":"worker","type":"result","attempt_id":"a9192b3bc8d51dab3c392be7f633a3a9","task_seq":25,"payload":{"v":1,"ts":"2026-11-26T10:18:33.952Z","seq":19,"type":"result","outputs":[],"summary":"修复后的代码仍然未能正确处理 CSV 文件中的数据行。问题可能出在 `csv.DictReader` 的使用上，它可能没有正确解析 CSV 数据。我们需要进一步调试和修复代码。\n\n让我们尝试另一种方法，确保 CSV 数据被正确解析，并且表头行被正确跳过。以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source.strip():\n        return []\n    try:\n        reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n        next(reader, None)  # 跳过表头行\n        return list(reader)\n    except csv.Error as e:\n        print(f\"CSV error: {e}\")\n        return []\n```\n\n我们将使用 `exec_shell` 运行测试以验证修复是否成功。","attempt_id":"a9192b3bc8d51dab3c392be7f633a3a9","session_state":{"state":{"turns":[{"user":"# CSV 首条记录丢失\n\n`read_records(\"name,city\\nAda,London\\n\")` 应返回一条包含 Ada 和 London 的记录，目前返回空列表。修复 `records.py`，保留 CSV 的字段解析与记录顺序。只有表头时应返回空列表。\n\n任务工作区从 `repo/` 创建。验收测试由评测端保管。\n\nThe contents of repo/ are already staged at the workspace root. The tool path for the target is exactly records.py. Use read_file on records.py first, write your change to records.py, then run a public smoke test with exec_shell.","reply":"修复后的代码仍然未能正确处理 CSV 文件中的数据行。问题可能出在 `csv.DictReader` 的使用上，它可能没有正确解析 CSV 数据。我们需要进一步调试和修复代码。\n\n让我们尝试另一种方法，确保 CSV 数据被正确解析，并且表头行被正确跳过。以下是修复后的代码：\n\n```python\nimport csv\nfrom io import StringIO\n\n\ndef read_records(source: str) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n    if not source.strip():\n        return []\n    try:\n        reader = csv.DictReader(StringIO(source))\n        next(reader, None)  # 跳过表头行\n        return list(reader)\n    except csv.Error as e:\n        print(f\"CSV error: {e}\")\n        return []\n```\n\n我们将使用 `exec_shell` 运行测试以验证修复是否成功。","route":"answer","report":null,"task_id":"task_d56b8cc55e7b0bbcf195da3b580aa505"}],"sources":[],"schema_version":1},"checkpoint_id":"4e47c249d0724afda16747ec84e696fa"}}}}

